      "Relationships":[["Create a thoughtful tradition","Plan a small recurring activity that helps you stay connected with someone."],["Have a considerate difficult conversation","If something needs addressing, prepare your thoughts and have a calm, respectful conversation."]],
      "Piano":[["Polish a performance end to end","Practise piano for 10 minutes, focusing on transitions, dynamics, and a confident ending."],["Learn and connect a full section","Practise piano for 10 minutes and work on connecting sections smoothly without stopping."]],
      "Fitness":[["Review progress and set a new training block","Use your training notes to set a realistic multi-week strength goal and plan recovery."],["Refine a main lift or movement","Choose a familiar strength movement and focus on repeatable technique across working sets."]],
